# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type | title }})

Provides a TACACS+ external authentication resource.

## Example Usage

```terraform
resource "wallix-bastion_externalauth_tacacs" "corporate" {
  authentication_name = "corporate_tacacs"
  host                = "tacacs.corporate.local"
  port                = 49
  secret              = var.tacacs_shared_secret
  description         = "Corporate TACACS+ server"
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Usage Notes

`secret` is the TACACS+ shared secret configured on the TACACS+ server for this Bastion.

## Import

TACACS+ external authentication can be imported using the authentication name, e.g.

```shell
terraform import wallix-bastion_externalauth_tacacs.corporate corporate_tacacs
```
